# Wheel Picker — a horizontal ruler (Skia tick paths translated by the scroll offset, snapping spring, haptic per tick) driving a SwiftUI numericText counter 0..50; an expand button springs the tick spacing 20↔50 and re-snaps the offset to the same tick.
# What this test covers: dragging to the end (counter 50) and back to 0 (asserted), expanding/collapsing the spacing at
# 0, mid-range and at 50 (re-snap), toggling spacing while the spacing spring and a snap
# spring are mid-flight, flings that overshoot the ends, grabbing the ruler mid-spring, and one-tick nudges.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/wheel-picker"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait "text" "0" 5000
wait 800
# Drag to the end with the compact spacing.
gesture pan 380 477 -370 0 900
wait 600
gesture pan 380 477 -370 0 900
wait 600
gesture pan 380 477 -370 0 900
wait 1200
wait "text" "50" 3000
# Expand at the end: spacing springs to 50 and the selected tick must hold.
press 338 794
wait 1200
wait "text" "50" 3000
# Collapse again: still 50.
press 338 794
wait 1200
wait "text" "50" 3000
# Back to 0 with drags.
gesture pan 20 477 370 0 900
wait 600
gesture pan 20 477 370 0 900
wait 600
gesture pan 20 477 370 0 900
wait 1200
wait "text" "0" 3000
# Expanded: drag into the middle.
press 338 794
wait 1000
gesture pan 380 477 -370 0 900
wait 1000
# Toggle spacing twice while its spring is running.
press 338 794
wait 150
press 338 794
wait 1200
# Fling past the end (spring overshoots), grab it mid-spring.
gesture pan 390 477 -380 0 120
wait 150
press 200 477
wait 1000
gesture pan 390 477 -380 0 120
wait 300
# Toggle spacing while the snap spring settles.
press 338 794
wait 1200
# One-tick nudges.
gesture pan 200 477 30 0 500
wait 600
gesture pan 200 477 -30 0 500
wait 600
# Fling back to 0 a few times.
gesture pan 20 477 370 0 120
wait 500
gesture pan 20 477 370 0 120
wait 500
gesture pan 20 477 370 0 120
wait 500
gesture pan 20 477 370 0 120
wait 500
gesture pan 20 477 370 0 120
wait 500
gesture pan 20 477 370 0 120
wait 1500
wait "text" "0" 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
